  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n **Signs**\n **Decoded signs**\n \n \n\n ÷\n -\n \n \n\n ×\n ÷\n \n \n\n +\n ×\n \n \n\n -\n +\n \n \n\n \n\n1) 8 ÷ 4 + 26 × 2 = 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs then:\n\n⇒ 8 - 4 × __**26 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 5\n\n⇒ 8 - __**4 × **__**__13__** = 5\n\n⇒ __**8 **____**-**____** **__**__**5**__2** = 5\n\n⇒ -44 ≠ 5\n\n2) 8 ÷ 4 + 2 - 6 × 2 = 4\n\nAfter interchanging the signs then:\n\n⇒ 8 - 4 × 2 + __**6 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 8 - __**4 **____**×**____** 2**__ + 3 = 4\n\n⇒ __**8 - 8 + 3**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 3 ≠ 4\n\n3) 12 ÷ 4 - 7 × 2 + 3 = 4\n\nAfter interchanging the signs then:\n\n⇒ 12 - 4 + __**7 **____**÷**____** 2**__ × 3 = 4\n\n⇒ 12 - 4 + __**3.5**____** ×**____** 3**__ = 4\n\n⇒ __**12**__ - 4 __**+ 10.5**__ = 4\n\n⇒ __**22.5 - 4**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 18.5 ≠ 4\n\n**4) 12 × 4 - 7 ÷ 2 + 3 = 4**\n\nAfter interchanging the signs then:\n\n⇒ __**12 ÷**____** 4**__ + 7 - 2 × 3 = 4\n\n⇒ 3 + 7 - __**2 **____**×**____** 3**__ = 4\n\n⇒ __**3 **____**+ 7**__ - 6 = 4\n\n⇒ __**10**____** - 6 **__= 4\n\n⇒ 4 = 4\n\nThus, **Option 4 eq**uation is correct.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**12 × 4 - 7 ÷ 2 + 3 = 14**\".",
